# Parent origins the block trusts for BLOCK_INIT (read by readAllowedOriginsFromEnv).
# - https://civitai.com + https://*.civitai.com   → prod (apex + subdomains)
# - https://*.civitaic.com                         → dynamic PR previews (pr-N.civitaic.com)
# The wildcard entries become load-bearing only once @civitai/blocks-react
# republishes with OriginMatcher (PR civitai/civitai-app-starters#32); the
# currently-published 0.5.0 does exact-match only, so we ALSO list the exact
# preview origins below — they work today and validate the previews now.
# (pr-2319 = the main App Blocks PR preview; pr-2447 = the anon-conversion
# validation preview; pr-2457 = the lazy-consent validation preview — all
# *.civitaic.com hosts the wildcard will cover automatically once the SDK
# republishes, at which point the exact pr-N entries can be dropped.)
VITE_BLOCK_ALLOWED_PARENT_ORIGINS=https://civitai.com,https://*.civitai.com,https://*.civitaic.com,https://pr-2319.civitaic.com,https://pr-2447.civitaic.com,https://pr-2457.civitaic.com
